- Implement a module exporting a canonical set of platform constants and a deprecated alias set (with the same values).
- Implement a verifier that:
  - Reads the TypeScript file as text and extracts all exported constants from both the new and deprecated sets.
  - Verifies that each new constant’s value matches its canonical label.
  - Verifies that each deprecated constant’s value equals the corresponding new constant’s value.
  - Writes a timestamped report to logs/verify.log and prints a final OK when all checks pass.

What to build
